{"id":"prepositions-0021","taskId":"prepositions","title":"Drill set 21","text":null,"source":"drill","gaps":[{"answer":"of","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"He was found guilty ___ fraud.","hint":"guilty ___ sth","explanation":"guilty OF a crime."},{"answer":"to","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Be kind ___ your little brother.","hint":"kind ___ sb","explanation":"kind TO somebody."},{"answer":"to","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"I much prefer coffee ___ tea.","hint":"prefer A ___ B","explanation":"prefer A TO B (never \u0027than\u0027)."},{"answer":"with","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"There\u0027s something wrong ___ this printer.","hint":"wrong ___ sth","explanation":"something wrong WITH something."},{"answer":"for","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Is there any excuse ___ being so rude?","hint":"excuse ___ sth","explanation":"an excuse FOR something/doing something."},{"answer":"about","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"She\u0027s always cared deeply ___ animal welfare.","hint":"care ___ sth (be concerned)","explanation":"care ABOUT = think it matters; care FOR = look after or like."},{"answer":"of","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"She\u0027s perfectly capable ___ managing the project alone.","hint":"capable ___ doing","explanation":"capable OF doing something."},{"answer":"to","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Plastic waste is a serious threat ___ marine life.","hint":"threat ___ sth/sb","explanation":"a threat TO somebody/something."}]}